# SonarQube configuration (manual token)
# 1) Login to SonarQube (http://localhost:9000), change admin password if forced on first login
# 2) My Account > Security > Generate Token (e.g. jenkins-ci)
# 3) Create quality gate named course-service with:
#    - new_violations > 0 (error)
#    - new_coverage < 90 (error)
#    - new_duplicated_lines_density > 3 (error)
#    Remove "All new Security Hotspots reviewed" if present. Set as Default or assign to the project.
# 4) Put the token below
SONAR_TOKEN=
